{"id":"en_heaven-has-not-forgotten","title":"Heaven Has Not Forgotten","titleEn":"Heaven Has Not Forgotten","description":"Lucas, a pediatric emergency physician, abandoned his own daughter in a sweltering vehicle so he could spend time with the son of his first love. Though he knew the child was in danger, he dismissed the ringing phone, disabled location tracking, and misled others about where he had parked. Vivian, his wife, went from lot to lot in a desperate search. Once the girl was located, Lucas turned on Vivian and accused her of concealing their daughter. Those wanting to follow this series can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/heaven-has-not-forgotten/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/heaven-has-not-forgotten/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Karma","Karma Payback","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cd688/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_heaven-has-not-forgotten_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cd688/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_heaven-has-not-forgotten_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cd688/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_heaven-has-not-forgotten_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cd688/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_heaven-has-not-forgotten_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cd688/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloa